---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us | Air Duct Cleaning Charleston SC" description="Local air duct cleaning team based on James Island serving Charleston, SC and surrounding communities.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Our Charleston Team</h1>
      <p>Local technicians focused on cleaner indoor air for Lowcountry homes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why We Do This Work</h2>
      <p>Coastal humidity, pollen seasons, and older duct systems mean many Charleston-area homes circulate more dust and allergens than they should. We started this service to give neighbors a straightforward, well-equipped option for professional air duct and dryer vent cleaning — without pressure tactics or mystery pricing.</p>
      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Based on James Island at 775 Folly Rd d</li>
        <li>Commercial-grade negative-pressure and HEPA equipment</li>
        <li>Clear quotes before work begins</li>
        <li>Respect for your home — floor protection and careful cleanup</li>
        <li>Same-day and next-day availability when possible</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Service Area</h2>
      <p>We primarily serve Charleston, James Island, Folly Beach, West Ashley, Mount Pleasant, North Charleston, and nearby Lowcountry communities. Call to confirm coverage for your address.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
